{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1209727-book-recommendations-for-cybernetics-iterators-and-enhancements","id":1209727,"title":"Book Recommendations for Cybernetics, Iterators and Enhancements?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-21T12:14:36-07:00","id":1209727,"title":"Book Recommendations for Cybernetics, Iterators and Enhancements?","content":"M20 has a brief list of examples of the enlightened upgrades that cyborgs may be given, due to limited space. What are the best resources for expanded rules and lists of examples, in 2nd Ed and Revised? Some recommended reading would be appreciated :-)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11620-twig","name":"twig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11620_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4568"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-21T13:30:02-07:00","id":1209758,"title":"","content":"As far as rules go, I think Guide to the Technocracy and ItX Rev are/were the main ones. (I never saw Forged in Dragons Fire so I don't know if it covered them or not.)<br /> <br /> \u200b(I'l try to add some to this later.)<br /> <br /> Added: Regarding biological enhancements, I got a lot of mileage out of the original <a href=\"http://www.sjgames.com/gurps/books/Bio-Tech/\" target=\"_blank\">GURPS Bio-Tech</a>. GURPS Transhuman Space setting series also did a bit with enhanced/modified humans. The <a href=\"http://www.sjgames.com/transhuman/fifthwave/\" target=\"_blank\">Fifth Wave</a> book included various people modified for different environments, which might give some ideas for Void Engineer agents/experiments. <a href=\"http://www.sjgames.com/transhuman/bioroidbazaar/\" target=\"_blank\">Bioroid Bazaar</a> is a PDF collection of Transhuman Space &quot;upgrade&quot; templates updated for 4th edition. <a href=\"http://www.sjgames.com/transhuman/shell-tech/\" target=\"_blank\">Shell Tech</a> is a similar collection of cyber- and bio-shell gear.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://www.sjgames.com/gurps/books/Ultra-Tech/\" target=\"_blank\">GURPS Ultra-Tech</a> does include material on cybernetics and other mechanical enhancements, but it's only a part of the book.<br /> <br /> You may also get some ideas from the<a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/204248/RiftsR-Bionics-Sourcebook\" target=\"_blank\"> Rifts Bionics Sourcebook</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":12890,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","user":"No One of Consequence","date":". 04-21-2018, 06:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}